WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Opening. The earlier opening paired the company promise with botanical photography and a Learn How action.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Newsletter. A newsletter sign-up followed the hero, before the page explained the supply-chain problem or production approach.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Plant science. The Power of Plants introduced regeneration and biotechnology. This scientific message was preserved in the redesign.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Supply-chain problem. The sourcing problem appeared after the plant-science section. The redesign moves this context earlier in the reading path.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Approach. The original page already used a plant-to-culture sequence. The redesign gives that explanation a stronger section hierarchy.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Saffron focus. What We’re Building introduced the initial saffron application after the scientific explanation and benefits.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Team & contact. The team and contact form closed the earlier page. Compare this ending with the redesigned team, contact, and newsletter paths.
